<title>UK: Robert Fleming sets $200 million July 2000 FRN.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming sets $200 million July 2000 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ROBERT FLEMING CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ROBERT FLEMING &amp; CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    05.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    +7 BP	PAY DATE  S 11.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     ISSUE	99.977    REOFFER     99.977</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> IBCA	 A+	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENLGISH   MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, DIRECT, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
